#
# Counter-example for math:ManifoldShape: a math:Manifold declaring its dimension but
# omitting math:manifoldStructureKind (sh:minCount 1). Validation MUST emit
# shacl.MinCountConstraintComponent (math:UnderspecifiedManifold). Bound by
# ex:ecManifoldMissingStructureKind.
@prefix math: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/> .
@prefix ex:   <http://example.org/math/> .

ex:formlessManifold a math:Manifold ;
    math:manifoldDimension 3 .
